b0806ab76d129a","url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/908773e3c727faf1e4b109d60b84cdb74484743f/libs/x-content/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xcontent/XContentParseException.java"},{"path":"libs/x-content/impl/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xcontent/provider/json/JsonXContentParser.java","source_commit":"908773e3c727faf1e4b109d60b84cdb74484743f","local_source":"docs/research/source-analysis/8.19.24/rank-metric-template-sources/JsonXContentParser.java","sha256":"c96c020e23ecc651fd60f0c5ea80091913f95c7f16ec744a0d8a92270434564d","git_blob":"aa806f458fe0adb85ff9cabc639478de55112de3","url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/908773e3c727faf1e4b109d60b84cdb74484743f/libs/x-content/impl/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xcontent/provider/json/JsonXContentParser.java"}],"findings":["MetricDetail nests each result under its metric name. Recall counts all rated relevant documents, including a relevant ID absent from the corpus; MRR uses a one-based first relevant position and -1 if none.","DCG discounts (2^rating-1)/log2(position+1). Normalization uses sorted rated documents limited by returned hit count. ERR uses stop probability (2^rating-1)/2^maximum_relevance and a continuing probability product. These arithmetic predictions need actual exact-binary replies.","TransportRankEvalAction forces metric k onto search size, fetches only summary_fields or disables _source, compiles templates once then renders request params. Parsing IO failures can enter the per-query failure map while another valid query proceeds. Other parser/runtime/template failures are not assumed equivalent.","RankEvalSpec.ScriptWithId parses default mustache scripts. RatedRequest rejects query plus template/params and params without template_id. Duplicate template IDs use Map.put so last source entry wins; this still requires native confirmation.","Exact JsonXContentParser converts EOF to XContentEOFException, whose parent XContentParseException extends IllegalArgumentException. Thus the selected malformed template output bypasses TransportRankEvalAction catch(IOException); expect a top-level400 even alongside a valid query. This is source-only until execution."],"native_plan":["Reuse the ready exact 8.19.24 main/image; no sibling, next image or version. Commit producer before HTTP.","Create one unique owned index with three known docs ordered by integer rank, grades 0/3/2 and a fourth absent rated ID with grade1. Verify count independently before and after ranking.","Compare precision, recall, MRR, DCG, nDCG and ERR against explicit arithmetic. Probe metric k overriding source size, zero relevant thresholds, unknown_doc_rating, inline mustache, summary_fields and selected conflicting input rejections.","Use one valid and one malformed template output together for a predicted whole-request400 probe; retain actual unexpected outcomes rather than updating expectations to conceal failure.","Bound each HTTP call and excerpt; retain request JSON, selected headers, actual status, hash/length and assertions. Delete only the owned index on a fully passing attempt, verify HEAD404, retain main for raw review and matrix freeze."],"expected_arithmetic":{"ordered_ratings":[0,3,2],"absent_rated_grade":1,"precision":0.6666666666666666,"recall":0.6666666666666666,"reciprocal_rank":0.5,"dcg":5.9165082750002025,"ideal_dcg":9.392789260714373,"expected_reciprocal_rank":0.453125},"limitations":["Only exact 8.19.24 and finite metric/template cases, not whole API coverage.","Stored scripts, arbitrary languages, unknown template IDs, distributed ranking, auth/TLS, runtime pressure and consumers remain separate."]},"primary_sources":[{"path":"modules/rank-eval/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/rankeval/RecallAtK.java","source_commit":"908773e3c727faf1e4b109d60b84cdb74484743f","local_source":"docs/research/source-analysis/8.19.24/rank-metric-template-sources/RecallAtK.java","sha256":"737000885ca1fcca2d63b3467a8710ee0b4671dd403bae63cc975d037b9c8d74","git_blob":"488